  <History Date="25-06-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Removed extraneous palettes.  Changed reserved to special group." />
  <History Date="06-07-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Added gobo wheel 1 swatches.  Revised frost and prism function names." />
